.claude/skills/bmad-*
build/
# The installer owns _bmad/ and regenerates it, so it stays out of the repo — EXCEPT
# _bmad/custom/, which BMad designates as the team-owned, committed layer (see the header of
# _bmad/config.toml). That is where this project's BMad skill overrides live, so it must be
# shared. Note both negations are required: re-including only the directory is not enough,
# because `_bmad/*` would still exclude its contents.
_bmad/*
!_bmad/custom/
!_bmad/custom/**
.venv/
.tmp/

.DS_Store
*/.DS_Store
__pycache__/
